同源码双 workflow CI 正在运行，尚无整体结论。\n- 修复验证：草稿读取/确认乱序、所选候选不同于编辑分支、存储失败与重挂载保全均有 RED/GREEN 和独立审查。首次恢复期间显示可读状态，真实会话或实际离线候选就绪后才开放导航。新增两条路线及两条首次恢复原生回归；既有原生测试正文不变。修复开发门禁不能替代当前完整验收。\n- 历史失败保留：4cf13f7 本地完整 native 为 77 PASS / 1 FAIL（路线保存）；双 CI browser 各 77 PASS / 1 FAIL（继续浏览示例），其余 10 检查 success。受控时序复现证实可达机制，不追认原失败唯一原因。be70e0c 原 Python 两项失败及修复同样保留。开发、原失败、修复和视觉证据均已整理到本地 progress/evidence，尚待证据提交发布。\n- 开发版推荐 1440/390 的 7 张真实截图已双人查看；本轮修复另有四张实际截图，路线 390×844、首次恢复 1440×900/390×900。原生行为与静态视觉分别记录，不代表 M7 全尺寸或学习效果验收。公开源码使用原创合成 fixture，暂存文件已扫描；运行库、密钥和个人教材不在提交中。\n\n下一步：完成固定提交完整 native、精确 CI 回读与证据独立审核，证据发布后才转 review。M5.1 仅只读协议准备；真实 Provider、Codex 与学习效果均 NOT_RUN。按规范不自动合并或关闭 Issue。\n","created_at":"2026-09-15T03:21:43Z","updated_at":"2026-09-15T04:34:37Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"430312770e4e75c876c997b542d0069af73b1538","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pulls/48/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pulls/48/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/issues/48/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/kl3574/Learning_Workbench/statuses/1db509f9bf4c296eb6fb7f3d99d94b5f243d2e7c","head":{"label":"kl3574:feat/M4.2-recommendations","ref":"feat/M4.2-recommendations","sha":"1db509f9bf4c296eb6fb7f3d99d94b5f243d2e7c","user":{"login":"kl3574","id":31810429,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODEwNDI5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31810429?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574","html_url":"https://github.com/kl3574","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kl3574/gis